OL,3,GNEWSABike lights at night could 'save  
OL,4,Ayour life'                             
OL,6,FPeople who illegally ride bikes in the 
OL,7,Fdark without displaying lights are     
OL,8,F"taking their life into their own      
OL,9,Fhands", it is claimed.                 
OL,11,FNeil Gregory, who chairs Beverley      
OL,12,FKnights Cycling Club, in East          
OL,13,FYorkshire, added: "The danger is not   
OL,14,Fbeing seen. You could be hit off your  
OL,15,Fbike, or the worse that could happen is
OL,16,Fyou could be killed."                  
OL,18,FCyclists must have a white front light,
OL,19,Fa red rear light and a red rear        
OL,20,Freflector, according to the Highway    
OL,21,FCode.                                  
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
