OL,3,GNEWSABike lights at night could 'save  
OL,4,Ayour life'                             
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Safer Roads Humber, 
OL,7,Fthe region's road safety partnership,  
OL,8,Fsaid: "Lighting is mandatory on cycles 
OL,9,Fduring the hours of darkness and may   
OL,10,Fresult in a fine if you are cycling    
OL,11,Fwithout them."                         
